# ============================================
# 📝 NOTES FOR DEVELOPERS
# ============================================
# ⚠️  NEVER commit these files:
# 1. serviceAccountKey.json - Contains Firebase Admin private key
# 2. appsettings.json - Contains SQL Server connection string with password
# 3. firebase-config.js - Contains Firebase API keys
# 4. sql-exports/ folder - Contains exported patient data (PII/PHI)
# 5. Any .env files - May contain secrets
#
# 📌 How to handle sensitive files:
# - Use environment variables for production
# - Share credentials through secure channels (1Password, LastPass, etc.)
# - Use .env.example as template without actual values
# - Document required configs in README.md
# ============================================